{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvUm9iaW5zb24lMjBDcnVzb2UlMjAlMjgxOTk3JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Robinson Crusoe","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/93uRPzVpf4ZVjDfswmpsrAmBS4w.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ynpag8C3nhpPrHIghrKH6kKXOSO.jpg","description":"Robinson Crusoe flees Britain on a ship after killing his friend over the love of Mary. A fierce ocean storm wrecks his ship and leaves him stranded by himself on an uncharted island. Left to fend for himself, Crusoe seeks out a tentative survival on the island, until he meets Friday, a tribesman whom he saves from being sacrificed. Initially, Crusoe is thrilled to finally have a friend, but he has to defend himself against the tribe who uses the island to sacrifice tribesman to their gods. During time their relationship changes from master-slave to a mutual respected friendship despite their difference in culture and religion.","releaseInfo":"1997","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.0","runtime":"92 min","cast":["Pierce Brosnan","Polly Walker","Ian Hart","James Frain","Damian Lewis","William Takaku","Ben Robertson","Martin Grace"],"director":["Rod Hardy","George T. Miller"],"released":"1997-06-11T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"One survivor. One island. One warrior. Two men, against all odds.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Pierce Brosnan","character":"Robinson Crusoe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dzXVwwJLPwiZeXOnf7YxorqVEEM.jpg"},{"name":"Polly Walker","character":"Mary","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eE8dtdlAwnMeramd1pA6eOQzhky.jpg"},{"name":"Ian Hart","character":"Daniel Defoe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xMC8aPDwhEZcjRHEFcgytSr3BzM.jpg"},{"name":"James Frain","character":"Robert/Defoe's Publisher","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1KnxsxRbVZkh5bdY3gA8v4YKhKR.jpg"},{"name":"Damian Lewis","character":"Patrick","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/puOXtVatFn